    "If you're already familiar with the basic concepts behind HTTP Host header vulnerabilities and just want to practice exploiting them on some realistic, deliberately vulnerable targets, you can access all of the labs in this topic from the link below." => 'Jika Anda sudah memahami dasar kerentanan HTTP Host header dan ingin langsung berlatih eksploitasi pada target simulasi yang rentan, akses semua lab pada topik ini melalui tautan berikut.',
    'View all HTTP Host header labs' => 'Lihat semua lab HTTP Host header',
    'What is the HTTP Host header?' => 'Apa itu HTTP Host header?',
    'The HTTP Host header is a mandatory request header as of HTTP/1.1. It specifies the domain name that the client wants to access. For example, when a user visits [[C0]], their browser will compose a request containing a Host header as follows:' => 'Header HTTP Host merupakan header permintaan wajib sejak HTTP/1.1 untuk menentukan nama domain yang ingin diakses klien. Saat pengguna membuka [[C0]], peramban mengirim permintaan seperti berikut:',
    'In some cases, such as when the request has been forwarded by an intermediary system, the Host value may be altered before it reaches the intended back-end component. We will discuss this scenario in more detail below.' => 'Pada kondisi tertentu, misalnya ketika permintaan diteruskan oleh sistem perantara, nilai Host dapat berubah sebelum mencapai server backend tujuan.',
    'What is the purpose of the HTTP Host header?' => 'Apa tujuan HTTP Host header?',
    "The purpose of the HTTP Host header is to help identify which back-end component the client wants to communicate with. If requests didn't contain Host headers, or if the Host header was malformed in some way, this could lead to issues when routing incoming requests to the intended application." => 'HTTP Host header membantu perantara dan server web mengenali komponen backend atau aplikasi tujuan yang diminta oleh klien.',
    "Historically, this ambiguity didn't exist because each IP address would only host content for a single domain. Nowadays, largely due to the ever-growing trend for cloud-based solutions and outsourcing much of the related architecture, it is common for multiple websites and applications to be accessible at the same IP address. This approach has also increased in popularity partly as a result of IPv4 address exhaustion." => 'Dahulu satu alamat IP umumnya hanya melayani satu domain. Kini, akibat arsitektur cloud dan keterbatasan alamat IPv4, satu alamat IP lazim melayani banyak situs sekaligus.',
    'When multiple applications are accessible via the same IP address, this is most commonly a result of one of the following scenarios.' => 'Kondisi banyak aplikasi berbagi satu alamat IP umumnya disebabkan oleh salah satu skenario berikut.',
    'Virtual hosting' => 'Virtual hosting',
    'One possible scenario is when a single web server hosts multiple websites or applications. This could be multiple websites with a single owner, but it is also possible for websites with different owners to be hosted on a single, shared platform. This is less common than it used to be, but still occurs with some cloud-based SaaS solutions.' => 'Satu server web dapat melayani banyak situs atau aplikasi sekaligus, baik milik satu organisasi maupun berbagai penyewa pada platform SaaS bersama.',
    'In either case, although each of these distinct websites will have a different domain name, they all share a common IP address with the server. Websites hosted in this way on a single server are known as "virtual hosts".' => 'Meski memiliki nama domain berbeda, seluruh situs tersebut memakai alamat IP server yang sama dan disebut "virtual host".',
    'To a normal user accessing the website, a virtual host is often indistinguishable from a website being hosted on its own dedicated server.' => 'Bagi pengguna biasa, situs berbasis virtual host tampak identik dengan situs di server terdedikasi.',
    'Routing traffic via an intermediary' => 'Routing lalu lintas melalui perantara',
    'Another common scenario is when websites are hosted on distinct back-end servers, but all traffic between the client and servers is routed through an intermediary system. This could be a simple load balancer or a reverse proxy server of some kind. This setup is especially prevalent in cases where clients access the website via a content delivery network (CDN).' => 'Pada arsitektur lain, situs berjalan di server backend terpisah, namun seluruh lalu lintas klien melewati sistem perantara seperti load balancer, reverse proxy, atau CDN.',
    'In this case, even though the websites are hosted on separate back-end servers, all of their domain names resolve to a single IP address of the intermediary component. This presents some of the same challenges as virtual hosting because the reverse proxy or load balancer needs to know the appropriate back-end to which it should route each request.' => 'Karena semua domain mengarah ke IP perantara yang sama, reverse proxy atau load balancer harus menentukan backend mana yang harus menerima tiap permintaan.',
    'How does the HTTP Host header solve this problem?' => 'Bagaimana HTTP Host header menyelesaikan masalah ini?',
    "In both of these scenarios, the Host header is relied on to specify the intended recipient. A common analogy is the process of sending a letter to somebody who lives in an apartment building. The entire building has the same street address, but behind this street address there are many different apartments that each need to receive the correct mail somehow. One solution to this problem is simply to include the apartment number or the recipient's name in the address. In the case of HTTP messages, the Host header serves a similar purpose." => 'Di kedua skenario tersebut, Host header berfungsi layaknya nomor unit apartemen pada surat: alamat gedungnya (IP) sama, tetapi Host header menentukan penerima (backend) yang dituju.',
    'When a browser sends the request, the target URL will resolve to the IP address of a particular server. When this server receives the request, it refers to the Host header to determine the intended back-end and forwards the request accordingly.' => 'Ketika permintaan tiba di IP server tujuan, server merujuk pada nilai Host header untuk meneruskannya ke backend yang sesuai.',
    'What is an HTTP Host header attack?' => 'Apa itu serangan HTTP Host header?',
    'HTTP Host header attacks exploit vulnerable websites that handle the value of the Host header in an unsafe way. If the server implicitly trusts the Host header, and fails to validate or escape it properly, an attacker may be able to use this input to inject harmful payloads that manipulate server-side behavior. Attacks that involve injecting a payload directly into the Host header are often known as "Host header injection" attacks.' => 'Serangan HTTP Host header mengeksploitasi situs yang memercayai nilai Host header secara membabi buta tanpa validasi atau escaping memadai, sehingga penyerang dapat menyuntikkan payload untuk memanipulasi perilaku server.',
    "Off-the-shelf web applications typically don't know what domain they are deployed on unless it is manually specified in a configuration file during setup. When they need to know the current domain, for example, to generate an absolute URL included in an email, they may resort to retrieving the domain from the Host header:" => 'Aplikasi web siap pakai kerap tidak mengetahui domain tempat ia dipasang sehingga mengambil nilai domain langsung dari Host header, misalnya saat membuat URL absolut pada email:',
    "The header value may also be used in a variety of interactions between different systems of the website's infrastructure." => 'Nilai header ini juga sering digunakan dalam komunikasi antarkomponen di infrastruktur situs.',
    'As the Host header is in fact user controllable, this practice can lead to a number of issues. If the input is not properly escaped or validated, the Host header is a potential vector for exploiting a range of other vulnerabilities, most notably:' => 'Karena Host header sepenuhnya dapat dikendalikan pengguna, penanganan yang tidak aman menjadikannya vektor untuk berbagai kerentanan lain, seperti:',
    'Web cache poisoning' => 'Web cache poisoning',
